WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.273
GRIFF: DAVID SPUNT, LIVE FOR US

00:00:03.306 --> 00:00:07.667
IN THE WHITE HOUSE, DAVID, THANK

00:00:07.678 --> 00:00:08.355
YOU.

00:00:08.366 --> 00:00:08.902
JACQUI.

00:00:08.935 --> 00:00:11.650
&gt;&gt; GOVERNMENT SHOULD NOT REQUIRE

00:00:11.651 --> 00:00:14.539
ANY TEXAN TO SHOW PROOF OF

00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:15.688
VACCINATION AND REVEAL PRIVATE

00:00:15.699 --> 00:00:17.417
HEALTH INFORMATION JUST TO GO

00:00:17.428 --> 00:00:18.266
ABOUT THEIR DAILY LIVES.

00:00:18.277 --> 00:00:20.492
&gt;&gt; BOTTOM LINE IS WE ARE GOING

00:00:20.503 --> 00:00:21.764
TO CONTINUE TO IMPLEMENT THE LAW

00:00:21.797 --> 00:00:23.125
WHICH THE PRESIDENT OF THE

00:00:23.127 --> 00:00:24.687
UNITED STATES HAS THE ABILITY,

00:00:24.698 --> 00:00:27.483
THE AUTHORITY, THE LEGAL

00:00:27.484 --> 00:00:28.831
AUTHORITY TO DO.

00:00:28.832 --> 00:00:30.565
JACQUI: TEXAS GOVERNOR GREG

00:00:30.576 --> 00:00:32.820
ABBOTT AND JEN PSAKI SPARRING

00:00:32.854 --> 00:00:35.176
OVER THE LEGALITY OVER THE BIDEN

00:00:35.187 --> 00:00:36.078
ADMINISTRATION’S VACCINE MANDATE

00:00:36.112 --> 00:00:38.122
AS THE FIGHT BETWEEN WHITE HOUSE

00:00:38.133 --> 00:00:38.958
AND REPUBLICAN GOVERNORS HEATS

00:00:38.969 --> 00:00:39.436
UP.

00:00:39.447 --> 00:00:40.934
JOINING US NOW FOR REACTION

00:00:40.945 --> 00:00:42.153
URBAN REFORM PRESIDENT AND

00:00:42.188 --> 00:00:43.882
MEMBER OF THE TEXAS ADVISORY

00:00:43.893 --> 00:00:46.631
COMMITTEE OF THE U.S. COMMISSION

00:00:46.642 --> 00:00:48.361
ON CIVIL RIGHTS CHARLES BLANE.

00:00:48.372 --> 00:00:49.929
THANK YOU SO MUCH FOR BEING WITH

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:50.708
US.

00:00:50.719 --> 00:00:53.396
&gt;&gt; THANKS FOR HAVING ME, JACQUI.

00:00:53.429 --> 00:00:54.686
JACQUI: WALK US THROUGH,

00:00:54.697 --> 00:00:56.060
CHARLES, WHAT’S YOUR TAKE ON

00:00:56.071 --> 00:00:57.351
WHERE THINGS STAND RIGHT NOW.

00:00:57.385 --> 00:00:58.285
&gt;&gt; APPLAUD THE GOVERNOR FOR

00:00:58.296 --> 00:00:59.564
DOING WHAT HE DID.

00:00:59.575 --> 00:01:01.144
I THINK ONE OF THE BIG THINGS

00:01:01.178 --> 00:01:02.660
THAT HAS BEEN A PART OF THE

00:01:02.671 --> 00:01:03.848
CONVERSATION ABOUT VACCINE AND

00:01:03.882 --> 00:01:05.417
VACCINE MANDATES IS THAT ONE OF

00:01:05.428 --> 00:01:07.099
THE BIG GROUPS THAT HAVE BEEN

00:01:07.133 --> 00:01:08.525
RELUCTANT TO GET THEM, THEY LOOK

00:01:08.536 --> 00:01:09.059
LIKE ME.

00:01:09.070 --> 00:01:10.921
SO WE ARE TALKING ABOUT BLACK

00:01:10.922 --> 00:01:12.103
AND HISPANIC FOLKS, LARGELY

00:01:12.114 --> 00:01:14.322
FOLKS WHO ARE WAGE WORKERS WHO

00:01:14.356 --> 00:01:15.760
ARE WORKING PUBLIC FACING JOBS

00:01:15.761 --> 00:01:17.676
SO THEY ARE REALLY GOING TO FEEL

00:01:17.687 --> 00:01:19.084
THE CRUNCH OF A VACCINE MANDATE.

00:01:19.095 --> 00:01:20.464
AND SO WITH THE GOVERNOR

00:01:20.498 --> 00:01:21.623
STEPPING IN, IT’S ENSURING THAT

00:01:21.634 --> 00:01:23.001
THEY DON’T HAVE TO MAKE THE

00:01:23.012 --> 00:01:24.735
DECISION OF THEIR LIVELIHOOD AND

00:01:24.746 --> 00:01:26.396
CONTINUING TO PUT FOOD ON THE

00:01:26.430 --> 00:01:28.108
TABLE VERSUS WHAT THEY FEEL IS

00:01:28.119 --> 00:01:29.563
RIGHT FOR THEIR PERSONAL HEALTH.

00:01:29.574 --> 00:01:31.576
SO I APPLAUD THE DECISION AND I

00:01:31.587 --> 00:01:32.984
THINK HE NEEDS TO HOLD STEADY ON

00:01:32.995 --> 00:01:33.286
IT.

00:01:33.319 --> 00:01:34.716
JACQUI: IN YOUR VIEW WHAT WOULD

00:01:34.727 --> 00:01:36.744
BE THE BETTER ROLE OF THE

00:01:36.755 --> 00:01:39.010
GOVERNMENT THEN TO TRY TONE

00:01:39.021 --> 00:01:41.090
COURAGE VACCINE HESITANT

00:01:41.124 --> 00:01:42.808
POPULATIONS TO GET VACCINATED?

00:01:42.809 --> 00:01:44.775
&gt;&gt; WELL, I THINK, YOU KNOW,

00:01:44.786 --> 00:01:46.457
LOCALLY HERE IN HARRIS COUNTY IN

00:01:46.468 --> 00:01:47.851
HOUSTON WE HAVE SEEN OUR LOCAL

00:01:47.862 --> 00:01:49.373
OFFICIALS GETTING OUT THERE AND

00:01:49.407 --> 00:01:50.660
GOING TO COMMUNITY EVENTS,

00:01:50.671 --> 00:01:51.721
HOLDING VACCINATION EVENTS,

00:01:51.732 --> 00:01:54.677
REALLY SHOWING THAT THEY ARE

00:01:54.711 --> 00:01:56.601
GETTING IT THEMSELVES AND THAT

00:01:56.612 --> 00:01:58.584
IT’S SAFE AND EFFECTIVE WAY OF

00:01:58.595 --> 00:01:59.841
COMBATING THE VIRUS BUT THE

00:01:59.874 --> 00:02:01.016
MANDATE DOESN’T SEEM TO BE THE

00:02:01.027 --> 00:02:01.504
ANSWER.

00:02:01.515 --> 00:02:02.865
ESPECIALLY BLACK AND HISPANIC

00:02:02.876 --> 00:02:04.484
FOLKS ARE HESITANT OF GOVERNMENT

00:02:04.495 --> 00:02:06.379
AND THEY HAVE A DEEP MISTRUST OF

00:02:06.390 --> 00:02:07.611
GOVERNMENT, SO MANDATING

00:02:07.612 --> 00:02:08.836
SOMETHING FROM GOVERNMENT IS NOT

00:02:08.847 --> 00:02:10.093
GOING TO FLY WITH THEM.

00:02:10.127 --> 00:02:11.661
AND SO I REALLY THINK THAT JUST

00:02:11.662 --> 00:02:12.941
GETTING OUT THERE AND

00:02:12.952 --> 00:02:13.842
COMMUNICATING CONTINUING TO

00:02:13.853 --> 00:02:15.416
COMMUNICATE THE MESSAGE OF THE

00:02:15.427 --> 00:02:16.941
NEED FOR VACCINES AND THE NEED

00:02:16.975 --> 00:02:18.344
FOR ENSURE THAT THE POPULATION

00:02:18.345 --> 00:02:19.932
IS SAFE IS GOING TO BE WITH THE

00:02:19.943 --> 00:02:20.582
ANSWER IS.

00:02:20.583 --> 00:02:22.201
I DON’T THINK MANDATES ARE IT.

00:02:22.202 --> 00:02:23.909
JACQUI: IN YOUR VIEW THE MANDATE

00:02:23.920 --> 00:02:25.733
DOES THE OPPOSITE, IT MAKES THEM

00:02:25.744 --> 00:02:26.620
FOR HESITANT?

00:02:26.654 --> 00:02:27.891
CHARLES: OH, WITHOUT A DOUBT.

00:02:27.902 --> 00:02:29.935
IT MAKES THEM MORE HESITANT AND

00:02:29.936 --> 00:02:31.844
I THINK IT MAKES THEM QUESTION

00:02:31.855 --> 00:02:33.133
THE MOTIVES OF GOVERNMENT SIMPLY

00:02:33.144 --> 00:02:34.443
BECAUSE NOW YOU’RE SAYING THAT

00:02:34.477 --> 00:02:36.087
THEY HAVE TO MAKE THE DECISION

00:02:36.088 --> 00:02:37.229
BETWEEN THEIR LIVELIHOOD AND

00:02:37.240 --> 00:02:38.218
WHAT THEY CHOOSE FOR THEIR

00:02:38.229 --> 00:02:38.912
PERSONAL HEALTH.

00:02:38.923 --> 00:02:40.965
I DEFINITELY THINK IT DOES THE

00:02:40.976 --> 00:02:42.911
COMPLETE OPPOSITE AND THERE WERE

00:02:42.922 --> 00:02:44.967
-- THERE WAS CONVERSATION

00:02:45.001 --> 00:02:47.180
SHORTLY AFTER HANDING OUT OF THE

00:02:47.191 --> 00:02:48.795
MANDATE THAT BLACK VOTERS WHO

00:02:48.829 --> 00:02:50.035
SUPPORTED PREVIOUSLY WERE A

00:02:50.046 --> 00:02:52.230
LITTLE MORE QUESTIONING WHAT HE

00:02:52.264 --> 00:02:54.121
WAS DOING AND THEY WERE MORE

00:02:54.132 --> 00:02:55.569
RELUCTANT TO SUPPORT HIM GOING

00:02:55.603 --> 00:02:56.465
FORWARD AND THAT’S A

00:02:56.476 --> 00:02:57.544
LONG-STANDING THING IF HE

00:02:57.578 --> 00:02:59.476
CONTINUES TO SHOVE THIS DOWN A

00:02:59.487 --> 00:03:00.912
POPULATION’S THROAT THAT HAS A

00:03:00.913 --> 00:03:02.373
DEEP MISTRUST OF GOVERNMENT.

00:03:02.384 --> 00:03:03.655
JACQUI: THE BIDEN ADMINISTRATION

00:03:03.666 --> 00:03:05.421
ALSO HAS BEEN CAREFUL TO TRY TO

00:03:05.432 --> 00:03:06.815
FIND WAYS WHERE THEY DO HAVE

00:03:06.849 --> 00:03:08.608
LEGAL GROUND TO DO THAT IN TERMS

00:03:08.619 --> 00:03:10.191
OF, YOU KNOW, ENCOURAGING

00:03:10.202 --> 00:03:12.064
BUSINESSES TO MAKE THESE

00:03:12.098 --> 00:03:14.764
MANDATES WHERE THEY CANNOT REACH

00:03:14.765 --> 00:03:16.234
OVER IN THEIR FEDERAL CAPACITY.

00:03:16.245 --> 00:03:17.884
DO YOU THINK THAT MAKES A

00:03:17.917 --> 00:03:19.794
DIFFERENCE IF IT’S COMING FROM,

00:03:19.805 --> 00:03:22.322
YOU KNOW, YOUR EMPLOYER AT THE

00:03:22.356 --> 00:03:24.748
URGING OF THE GOVERNMENT VERSUS,

00:03:24.759 --> 00:03:27.056
YOU KNOW, SOME SORT OF A MANDATE

00:03:27.090 --> 00:03:28.782
THAT’S ENACTED BY THE DEPARTMENT

00:03:28.793 --> 00:03:30.472
OF LABOR FOR CERTAIN EMPLOYERS,

00:03:30.506 --> 00:03:31.795
MORE THAN 100 WORKERS, DO YOU

00:03:31.806 --> 00:03:32.834
THINK THAT THAT MAKES A

00:03:32.868 --> 00:03:34.179
DIFFERENCE IF IT’S COMING FROM

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:35.757
THE WHITE HOUSE VERSUS THE

00:03:35.792 --> 00:03:36.587
PERSON YOU WORK FOR?

00:03:36.589 --> 00:03:37.824
&gt;&gt; CHARLES: I DON’T THINK IT

00:03:37.835 --> 00:03:38.616
MAKES A DIFFERENCE FOR THE

00:03:38.627 --> 00:03:41.321
AVERAGE PERSON BECAUSE AT THE

00:03:41.332 --> 00:03:43.637
END OF THE DAY, THEY THEN HAVE

00:03:43.670 --> 00:03:45.830
TO MAKE THE DECISION BETWEEN

00:03:45.832 --> 00:03:47.379
WHAT THEY’RE CHOOSING FOR

00:03:47.390 --> 00:03:48.895
PERSONAL HEALTH CARE AND PUT

00:03:48.929 --> 00:03:50.509
FOOD ON THE TABLE AND BRING

00:03:50.510 --> 00:03:51.592
PAYCHECK EVERY TWO WEEKS OR THE

00:03:51.603 --> 00:03:52.485
END OF THE MONTH.

00:03:52.519 --> 00:03:53.792
I DON’T THINK IT MAKES MUCH OF A

00:03:53.803 --> 00:03:54.897
DIFFERENCE AND I THINK PEOPLE

00:03:54.908 --> 00:03:56.813
RECOGNIZE THAT THE FORCE OF THIS

00:03:56.846 --> 00:03:58.054
IS STILL COMING FROM GOVERNMENT.

00:03:58.065 --> 00:03:59.604
THAT WHETHER OR NOT THEIR

00:03:59.615 --> 00:04:01.141
EMPLOYERS CHOOSE TO ADHERE TO A

00:04:01.175 --> 00:04:02.750
MANDATE OR VIOLATE IT THEMSELVES

00:04:02.761 --> 00:04:04.329
AND PUT THEMSELVES AT RISK, THAT

00:04:04.330 --> 00:04:05.483
FORCE, THAT STRONG ARM OF THE

00:04:05.494 --> 00:04:06.659
FEDERAL GOVERNMENT IS STILL

00:04:06.670 --> 00:04:08.303
COMING DOWN AND SO YOU KNOW

00:04:08.337 --> 00:04:09.649
THAT’S WHY, AGAIN, I APPLAUD

00:04:09.660 --> 00:04:12.329
GOVERNOR ABBOTT FOR WHAT HE DID

00:04:12.340 --> 00:04:13.881
AND I’M APPLAUDING OUR TEXAS

00:04:13.892 --> 00:04:15.055
LEGISLATURE FOR CONSIDERING

00:04:15.056 --> 00:04:17.998
LEGISLATION TO CODIFY WHAT HIS

00:04:18.009 --> 00:04:19.561
EXECUTIVE ORDER SAYS.

